# WP-HLOD-HASH: an HLOD's checksum covers only what the HLOD is built from (UE UHLODBuilder::ComputeHLODHash over
# AActor::IsHLODRelevant actors). WorldCells::HLODBuildChecksum hashes each member's Rules::HLODSourceOf - its HLOD
# source blocks (StaticMesh, InstancedStaticMesh, Foliage, a SkinnedMesh's presence, every module's HLOD builder
# component: LandscapeTile, LandscapeSpline), id, parent, transform and its ancestors' transforms - and the assets
# those blocks name; a member with none (a pawn's controller, a trigger, a player start, a light) adds nothing.
# The new form stales every saved HLOD once: this scenario rebuilds the HLODs of every World Partition world of
# Projects/Desert through Build HLODs (WP_Protocol, WP21_PrefabSpan_Far, WP21_PrefabSpan_Near, WP23_Regions; FOLIAGE_Edit
# states no HLOD layer), then Play's far view of WP_Protocol.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Тогда 0_wp_protocol_built WP_Protocol: World Partition panel, HLODs «0 stale HLOD»; editor.log «built N of N HLOD cells», read back 0 stale
Дано run Scene "Open Scene WP21_PrefabSpan_Far.desce"
Дано wait-idle 60
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Тогда 1_far_built WP21_PrefabSpan_Far: «0 stale HLOD» after its Build HLODs
Дано run Scene "Open Scene WP21_PrefabSpan_Near.desce"
Дано wait-idle 60
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Тогда 2_near_built WP21_PrefabSpan_Near: «0 stale HLOD» after its Build HLODs
Дано run Scene "Open Scene WP23_Regions.desce"
Дано wait-idle 60
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Тогда 3_regions_built WP23_Regions: «0 stale HLOD» after its Build HLODs
Когда run Scene "Open Scene WP_Protocol.desce"
Когда wait-idle 60
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -6000,3000,5124
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 1,-0.02,0
Когда advance 2
Тогда hlod_hash_view_near HH-06: 600 m from house 200414, the houses beyond the Main range drawn by their HLODs as in dev's frame of the same view (pixel diff named); HH-07: editor.log of this Play has no "stale HLOD"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,40000,-60000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.6,1
Когда advance 2
Тогда hlod_hash_view_far HH-06: WP_Protocol from 400 m up, every far cell drawn by its HLOD (no hole, no doubled block) as in dev's frame (pixel diff named)
Когда run Action "Stop"
# [hlod_hash_gameplay] / [hlod_hash_source] (WorldCook, not DesertCtl steps): on the rebuilt WP_Protocol, each edit
# in Main cell G0L0(0,0) is made in the editor and saved, then from Projects/Desert
#   WorldCook Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce --out <scratch>/wc/<HH> --project Desert.deproj --project-registry
# and the edit is reverted with `git restore` of the files it wrote:
#   HH-01 Player 9000001 gains a CharacterController (MaxStepHeight 45, then 60): 0 World Partition issue(s).
#   HH-04 a PlayerStart and a trigger volume added at (500, -200, 500): 0 issue(s).
#   HH-02 Foliage Bush 0_0 (200978) moved 3 m on X: StaleHLOD for exactly G0L0(0,0)'s HLOD and its parents.
#   HH-03 Foliage Bush 0_0's material slot replaced: StaleHLOD for that cell and its parents.
# [hlod_hash_view] HH-05: WorldCook of WP_Protocol, WP21_PrefabSpan_Far, WP21_PrefabSpan_Near, WP23_Regions,
# FOLIAGE_Edit: 0 issue(s) each.
